sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as 用户
    participant MW as MainWindow
    participant TR as tab_registry
    participant T as VideoDownloadTab
    participant W1 as worker(QThread)
    participant W2 as login_worker(QThread)

    Note over U,MW: ① P0 关窗清理（closeEvent）
    U->>MW: 关闭窗口
    MW->>TR: closeEvent → 遍历 TABS
    MW->>TR: stop_tab_threads(video_download_tab)
    TR->>T: vars(tab) 扫描 QThread 属性
    TR->>W1: worker.isRunning()? → stop()
    TR->>W1: wait(1500)
    TR->>W2: login_worker.isRunning()? → stop()
    TR->>W2: wait(1500) / terminate() 兜底
    MW->>MW: event.accept()，进程退出

    sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant M as video_resizer
    participant E as core.encoder
    participant F as ffmpeg

    Note over M,F: ② encoder 首次探测 + 缓存
    M->>E: get_encoder(crf=23)
    E->>E: is_nvenc_available() → 缓存 None
    E->>F: ffmpeg -encoders
    F-->>E: 含 h264_nvenc
    E->>F: ffmpeg testsrc 0.3s 试编码
    F-->>E: returncode=0
    E->>E: _state[nvenc_available]=True（缓存）
    E-->>M: ("h264_nvenc", "p1", ["-cq","23"])
    M->>E: get_default_workers() → 3（裂变用）

    sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant W as VideoResizeWorker
    participant R as VideoResizer
    participant MU as media_utils
    participant E2 as encoder
    participant RUN as ffmpeg_runner
    participant F2 as ffmpeg

    Note over W,F2: ③ resize_video 改造后执行 + 硬件回退
    W->>R: resize_video(path, out)
    R->>MU: probe_video(path) → dict(width,height,...)
    R->>E2: get_encoder(crf=23) → (codec,preset,quality_args)
    R->>RUN: run_ffmpeg_with_fallback(build_cmd, crf=23)
    RUN->>F2: Popen(cmd, CREATE_NO_WINDOW)
    F2-->>RUN: communicate()
    alt 硬件失败(FFmpegError & codec != libx264)
        RUN->>E2: fallback_to_software()（全局回退）
        RUN->>F2: 重试 libx264 一次
    else 成功
        RUN-->>R: FFmpegResult(returncode=0)
    end
    R-->>W: output_path

    sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant WF as VideoFissionWorker
    participant VF as VideoFission
    participant RUN2 as ffmpeg_runner
    participant F3 as ffmpeg

    Note over WF,F3: ④ 裂变中断编排（request_stop）
    WF->>VF: request_stop()
    VF->>RUN2: terminate_all()
    RUN2->>F3: 对所有被追踪进程 terminate()
    F3-->>RUN2: 各 ffmpeg 退出
    VF->>VF: partial_results 保留已完成项
